# EmberBSD AI-assisted adaptation uses official release assets and a current
# upstream US English dictionary. Keep all upstream copyright notices.
# Cross builds run Perl on the build host; installed scripts use target Perl.

--- a/textproc/hunspell/Makefile
+++ b/textproc/hunspell/Makefile
@@ -1,23 +1,25 @@
-# $NetBSD: Makefile,v 1.46 2026/05/07 16:34:35 adam Exp $
